# NPClaude speech: family. The format and every fact and word are described in basics.speech.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Romance between NPCs, said aloud. [listener] is the other NPC.

== ask_out ==
[listener], would you... maybe go out with me?
[listener]. I like you. A lot. Want to go out sometime?
So, [listener]. You and me. What do you think?
I've been meaning to ask you something, [listener]...
[listener]! Be mine?         {romantic, w=3}
I'll be blunt: date me, [listener]. {rude, w=3}
I'll be blunt: date me, [listener]. {honest, w=2}

== ask_out_yes ==
Yes! I'd love to.
I was hoping you'd ask.
Took you long enough.        {rude, w=3}
Oh! I... yes. Yes.           {introvert, w=3}
Finally!                     {romantic, w=3}

== ask_out_no ==
I'm sorry. I don't feel that way.
Oh... I'm flattered, but no.
You're sweet. But no.        {polite, w=3}
No. Absolutely not.          {rude, w=3}
Let's just be friends, okay? {forgiving, w=2}

== propose ==
[listener]... will you marry me?
I've been thinking. Let's get married, [listener].
[listener], I want to spend the rest of my life with you.
Marry me, [listener]. Please. {romantic, w=3}
So. Marriage. You and me. Yes? {taciturn, w=3}

== accept_proposal ==
Yes! A thousand times, yes!
Yes. Of course, yes.
I thought you'd never ask!   {romantic, w=3}
...Yes.                      {taciturn, w=3}

== wedding ==
[taught_happy]! We're married! {w=4}
We're married! We're actually married!
Husband and wife. Or... you know what I mean. Married!
Cube God bless this marriage! {pious, w=4}
Best day of my life.         {sentimental, w=3}
I do. I really do.           {romantic, w=3}

== wedding_guest ==
Congratulations!
To the happy couple!
Oh, I love weddings!         {romantic, w=3}
Is there cake? There's always cake. {glutton, w=4}
I give it a year.            {pessimist, w=3}
I give it a year.            {rude, w=2}
*sniff* I always cry at weddings. {sentimental, w=4}
Cube God bless you both.     {pious, w=3}
Who's next, I wonder?        {nosy, w=3}

== break_up ==
I can't do this anymore, [listener]. It's over.
We're done, [listener].
I'm sorry, [listener]. I don't love you anymore.
It's over. Don't follow me.  {rude, w=3}
I think we both know this isn't working. {serious, w=3}
Goodbye, [listener].         {taciturn, w=3}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Romance with the player, in conversation

== want_to_talk ==
[listener], can we talk later? Just... come find me.
Hey, [listener]. Come talk to me when you have a minute.
There's something I want to ask you, [listener].
[listener]! I need to ask you something. In private. {romantic, w=2}

== ask_player_out ==
Can I ask you something? Would you... maybe go out with me?
I've been thinking about you a lot, [listener]. Will you go out with me?
I'm just going to say it. I like you. Do you want to go out sometime?
I like you, [listener]. As more than a friend. Would you be mine? {romantic, w=3}
So. You and me. How about it? {lighthearted, w=3}
I'm bad at this. Will you... date me? {introvert, w=3}
I'm bad at this. Will you... date me? {timid, w=3}

== propose_to_player ==
[listener]... I've never been surer of anything. Will you marry me?
I want to spend the rest of my life with you. Marry me?
Will you marry me, [listener]?
Marry me, [listener]. Please say yes. {romantic, w=3}
I had a whole speech. I forgot it. Will you marry me? {lighthearted, w=3}
The Cube God brought us together. Will you marry me? {pious, w=3}

== player_said_yes ==
[taught_happy]! Really?        {w=4}
Really? Oh, that's wonderful!
You mean it? I'm so happy!
Yes! I mean, good. That's good. Yes.  {introvert, w=3}
I knew it!                   {proud, w=3}
This is the best day ever!   {extrovert, w=3}

== player_accepted_proposal ==
We're getting married! We're actually getting married!
You said yes! You said yes!
I'm the luckiest person alive.
Cube God be praised!         {pious, w=3}

== player_said_no ==
[taught_sad]. Okay.            {w=4}
Oh. I see.
I... understand. Sorry I asked.
Right. Forget I said anything.
Oh. Well. That's that, then. {pessimist, w=3}
Your loss.                   {proud, w=4}
Your loss.                   {rude, w=3}
I'll get over it. Probably.  {lighthearted, w=3}

== player_wants_time ==
Take your time. I'll be here.
Of course. Think it over.
Don't take too long, all right? {rude, w=3}
I'll wait. I'm good at waiting. {zen, w=3}

== ask_out_taken ==
I'm seeing [partner], actually.
Sorry. I'm with [partner].
I'm with [partner]. You know that. {rude, w=3}
Oh! I'm flattered, but [partner] wouldn't like that. {polite, w=3}

== ask_out_you_are_taken ==
Aren't you with [partner]?
What would [partner] say?
Don't you already have [partner]? {rude, w=3}
I'm not getting in between you and [partner]. {honest, w=3}
Oh, I'm telling [partner] about this. {nosy, w=4}

== ask_out_not_yet ==
I like you, but... not like that. Not yet, anyway.
Let's get to know each other better first.
You're sweet. Ask me again some other time?
Ha! Buy me a few more gifts first. {greedy, w=3}
Ha! Nice try.                {lighthearted, w=3}
No.                          {opinion=neutral, rude, w=3}

== about_us ==
Yes, love?
What is it?
Us? What about us?
Is everything all right?     {timid, w=3}
Uh oh. That sounds serious.  {lighthearted, w=3}

== proposal_too_soon ==
It's... a little soon, isn't it?
Slow down! We've only just started seeing each other.
Ask me again when we've been together a while.
I love that you asked. But not yet. {romantic, w=3}

== proposal_yes ==
Yes! Of course, yes!
Yes. Yes, yes, yes!
I'd be honored.              {proper, w=3}
I thought you'd never ask!   {romantic, w=3}

== wedding_too_soon ==
Soon. Let's not rush it.
We've only just gotten engaged. Let's enjoy it a little.
Not yet. I want it to be perfect. {proud, w=3}

== wedding_day ==
I can't believe it. We're married!
Married. To you. I'm so happy.
This is the best day of my life.
Cube God bless us both.      {pious, w=3}
Til death do us part. Well, maybe not death, but you know. {lighthearted, w=3}

== break_up_heard ==
[taught_sad]... fine.          {w=3}
...I see.
What? Why?
I thought... never mind what I thought.
Fine. Go, then.              {rude, w=3}
I'll remember this.          {vengeful, w=3}
I hope you find what you're looking for. {forgiving, w=3}
*sniff* Okay.                {sentimental, w=3}

== divorce_heard ==
A divorce? After everything?
...If that's what you want.
I never want to see you again. {vengeful, w=3}
I hope you're happy.         {rude, w=3}

== no_family ==
No family to speak of. Just me.
It's just me, I'm afraid.
Never had much family. That's fine.
Family? Haven't found mine yet. {romantic, w=3}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Children. [baby] is the newborn's name; baby_gender is male or female.

== new_baby ==
It's here! Our baby is here! Meet [baby]!
We have a baby! [baby]. Isn't [baby] perfect?
Everyone, meet [baby]!
It's a girl! We're calling her [baby]. {baby_gender=female, w=4}
It's a boy! We're calling him [baby]. {baby_gender=male, w=4}
Cube God, thank you for [baby]. {pious, w=4}
I'm a parent. Me! A parent!  {extrovert, w=3}
Oh, [baby]. Look at those tiny hands. {sentimental, w=4}

== grown_up ==
I'm all grown up!
Look at me! I'm a grown-up now.
No more kid stuff for me.
Finally! Nobody can tell me when to go to bed.  {lighthearted, w=3}
Time to get to work, I suppose. {hardworking, w=3}
Being a grown-up looks hard.  {pessimist, w=3}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Birthdays: said once, on the day, to whoever's around.

== birthday ==
It's my birthday today!
Guess what? It's my birthday!
Another year older!
Happy birthday to me!
Happy birthday to me! ...Anyone? No? {pessimist, w=3}
Cube God, thank you for another year. {pious, w=3}
Birthday cake! Is there birthday cake? {glutton, w=4}
I'm not getting older. I'm getting better. {proud, w=3}
It's my birthday. Please don't make a fuss. {introvert, w=3}
It's my birthday! Everybody, it's my birthday! {extrovert, w=3}
I'm a whole year bigger! {age=child, w=8}
